### AutoHub API - Vehicles & Leads Demo Requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@portalUrl = http://rederevenda.com
@tenant1Url = http://autocar-natal.app-loja.rederevenda.com

### 1. Global Search (Main Portal - lists all vehicles)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles
Accept: application/json
Host: rederevenda.com

### 2. Global Search with filters (Text query and Price range)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles?q=corolla&price_min=50000&price_max=120000
Accept: application/json
Host: rederevenda.com

### 3. Tenant-Specific Search (AutoCar Natal - filtered automatically)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles
Accept: application/json
Host: autocar-natal.app-loja.rederevenda.com

### 4. Geolocated Radius Search (Within 50km of Natal/RN coordinates)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles?lat=-5.7944&lng=-35.2110&radius=50
Accept: application/json
Host: rederevenda.com

### 5. View Vehicle Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles/1
Accept: application/json

### 6. Submit a Client Lead / Proposal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/leads
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "João da Silva",
  "email": "joao@example.com",
  "phone": "+55 84 99999-8888",
  "message": "Tenho interesse neste veículo! Aceita troca?",
  "vehicle_id": 1
}
